# Summary

Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter. [[cite:obs-e20e447251c42e34cfd9d493099b46923d3672bb "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January. [[cite:obs-354890e2fb3a8fc5b819ffe5bec29b9e8e428d3e "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]
